  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 127 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA posted the cisplatin shortage on 2023-02-10 and as of 2026-10-21 it has been on the list for 44 months.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An FDA inspection of the Thymoorgan Pharmazie GmbH plant (FEI 3002320821) ended on 2022-10-06 and was classified VAI, 127 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A subsequent inspection of the same plant ended on 2023-04-25 and was also classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2023-07-10, 74 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D4", "E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant is listed as a registered manufacturing site for a Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. cisplatin label (NDC 00143950401).",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier inspections of this plant in 2010, 2014, and 2019 were also classified VAI.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E8", "E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 166 units at 9.3 units per day (18 days on hand) and Corvale General holds 270 units at 8.7 units per day (31 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    }
  ]
}
